# 38. IMPORTANT EXAM POINT

If you see:

```text
TLS
Encrypted Application Data
```

you generally cannot simply read the application content from the packet capture without the appropriate cryptographic/session keys and supported decryption setup.

Therefore:

> **Packet capture ≠ automatic plaintext visibility.**

