# 61. POSSIBLE C2 INDICATORS

C2 = Command and Control.

Potential network indicators include:

- Repeated periodic connections
- Unusual destinations
- Suspicious domains
- Unexpected protocols
- Beacon-like timing
- Unusual DNS behavior
- Connections to rare external destinations

Again:

> One indicator alone does not prove C2.

