# 62. NETWORK SCAN DETECTION

Suppose:

```text
192.168.1.50
      ↓
22
23
25
53
80
110
139
443
445
3389
```

Many connection attempts to different ports may indicate:

> Port scanning.

Useful filters include:

```text
tcp.flags.syn == 1 && tcp.flags.ack == 0
```

Then investigate the source/destination pattern.

---

# 63. POSSIBLE DATA EXFILTRATION

Potential indicators:

- Large outbound transfer
- Unusual destination
- Unexpected protocol
- Unusual upload timing
- Repeated transfers
- Large DNS queries in unusual circumstances

Do not conclude exfiltration from volume alone.

