# 64. PACKET ANALYSIS METHODOLOGY

Use:

> **O-F-I-V-R**

### O — Observe

Understand the capture.

### F — Filter

Reduce noise.

### I — Investigate

Follow conversations.

### V — Validate

Check evidence and context.

### R — Report

Document findings.

