# 71. FALSE POSITIVES

Periodic traffic can also be caused by:

- Software updates
- Antivirus
- Cloud synchronization
- Monitoring agents
- Messaging applications
- Time synchronization
- Legitimate APIs

Therefore:

> **Pattern ≠ Proof**

