# 96. EXAM TRAPS

### Trap 1

**"Wireshark is a vulnerability scanner."**

❌ False.

Wireshark is primarily a packet/protocol analyzer.

---

### Trap 2

**"Promiscuous mode lets you see all switched traffic."**

❌ False.

Switch forwarding behavior still matters.

---

### Trap 3

**"HTTP and HTTPS are equally visible in Wireshark."**

❌ False.

HTTPS/TLS protects application content.

---

### Trap 4

**"Every SYN means an attack."**

❌ False.

SYN is a normal TCP connection mechanism.

---

### Trap 5

**"Every unusual DNS query is malware."**

❌ False.

It is an indicator requiring investigation.

---

### Trap 6

**"A packet capture always contains readable passwords."**

❌ False.

Encryption can protect application data.

